  "prompt": "Which account of each segment has the highest MRR in euros on 2025-12-31? An account's MRR on 2025-12-31 is the sum of its subscription events' mrr_delta_local with event_date on or before 2025-12-31, in the subscription's currency; convert it to euros at the fx_rates rate of 2025-12-31 for that currency. When accounts of a segment tie for the highest MRR, they share the place and every one of them is kept. Return three columns, in this order: segment, account_id and mrr_eur, the account's MRR in euros on 2025-12-31. Return one row for each account kept. Any row order is fine.",
